---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Nursery — The Forktree Project" description="The Forktree Project's on-site native plant nursery propagates locally provenanced species for habitat restoration across the Hills and Fleurieu region.">

  <!-- Nursery Hero / Intro -->
  <section class="nur-section nur-section--hero" style="background-image: url('/images/nursery/img_4232.jpg'); background-color: #2a3a2a;">
    <div class="nur-section__content nur-section__content--center">
      <div class="nur-text nur-text--wide">
        <h1>The Forktree Project Nursery</h1>

        <div class="nur-body">
          <p class="nur-tagline">Supporting the region&rsquo;s biodiversity revival.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Supporting Regional Rewilding -->
  <section class="nur-section nur-section--plain">
    <div class="nur-section__content nur-section__content--center">
      <div class="nur-text nur-text--wide">
        <h2>Supporting Regional Rewilding</h2>

        <div class="nur-body">
          <p>The Forktree Project Nursery grows a wide range of endemic native species to meet the needs of a variety of planting projects, including:</p>

          <ul class="nur-list">
            <li>large&#8209;scale habitat restoration and conservation projects</li>
            <li>private landholders looking to restore ecological health on their properties</li>
            <li>our own restoration program on the Forktree Project site itself</li>
          </ul>

          <p>We are proud to have grown over 75,000 plants of over 175 different species in the nursery this year.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Restoration-led Provenance -->
  <section class="nur-section nur-section--plain">
    <div class="nur-section__content nur-section__content--center">
      <div class="nur-text nur-text--wide">
        <h2>Restoration-led Provenance</h2>

        <div class="nur-body">
          <p>All plants in The Forktree Project Nursery are grown from seed and plant material of carefully selected provenance to ensure long-term ecological resilience in their destination sites.</p>

          <p>Seed and plant materials are responsibly collected by the Forktree Nursery team from a range of sources, including:</p>

          <ul class="nur-list">
            <li>our own Rare Seed Orchard</li>
            <li>the wider property itself (both remnant vegetation and maturing restoration plants)</li>
            <li>partner sites</li>
            <li>trusted local suppliers</li>
            <li>the South Australian Seed Conservation Centre</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Guided by ecological knowledge -->
  <section class="nur-section" style="background-image: url('/images/nursery/img_4350.jpg'); background-color: #1a2a1a;">
    <div class="nur-section__content nur-section__content--center">
      <div class="nur-text nur-text--wide">
        <h2>Guided by ecological knowledge</h2>

        <div class="nur-body">
          <p>We work closely with clients to advise on species best suited to their site, drawing on our team&rsquo;s extensive knowledge of local flora and best-practice restoration methods.</p>

          <p>To discuss your habitat restoration needs, please contact us at <a href="mailto:nursery@theforktreeproject.com">nursery@theforktreeproject.com</a>. We&rsquo;d love to work with you.</p>

          <div class="nur-cta">
            <a href="mailto:nursery@theforktreeproject.com" class="btn--cta">Get in Touch</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>

<style>
  .nur-section {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-attachment: scroll;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .nur-section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% 45%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 0%, transparent 100%),
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .nur-section--plain {
    background: #fafaf9;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    min-height: auto;
  }

  .nur-section--plain::before {
    display: none;
  }

  .nur-section--plain .nur-text {
    text-shadow: none;
  }

  .nur-section--plain .nur-text h2 {
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .nur-section--plain .nur-body p {
    opacity: 1;
    color: #333;
  }

  .nur-section--plain .nur-body strong {
    color: #1a1a1a;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .nur-section__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1600px;
    padding: 180px 100px;
  }

  .nur-section__content--center {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .nur-text {
    max-width: 50%;
    position: relative;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7), 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .nur-text--wide {
    max-width: 65%;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .nur-text h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .nur-text h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .nur-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .nur-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.8vw, 1.4rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.4;
    opacity: 0.95;
    margin-top: -0.5rem;
  }

  .nur-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin: 0.5rem auto 1.5rem;
    max-width: 640px;
    text-align: left;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.8;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .nur-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .nur-section--plain .nur-list {
    color: #333;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .nur-body a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .nur-body a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .nur-cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .btn--cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: white;
    border: 2px solid white;
    padding: 13px 26px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .btn--cta:hover {
    background-color: white;
    color: #000;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .nur-section {
      background-attachment: scroll;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .nur-section__content {
      padding: 100px 30px;
    }

    .nur-text,
    .nur-text--wide {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
